  t('<b>Hess 1960: sea-floor spreading</b>', 'War-time research: ocean floor full of relief (ranges, trenches)', '<b>Mid-oceanic ridges</b> most volcanically active; ocean floors not static', 'Rocks equidistant either side of ridge crest similar in constituents and age', '<b>Shallow-focus</b> quakes at ridges (deep-focus at Himalayan belt)', 'Oceanic rocks <b>much younger</b> than continental (subduct)'),
