  t('<b>Ring of Fire</b> (Pacific boundary, NZ → Chile)', '<b>70% earthquakes, 90% volcanoes (75% of active)</b>', '<b>20%</b> earthquakes in Mid-continental belt', 'Slowest ridge <b>Arctic</b> (&lt;2.5 cm/yr); fastest <b>East Pacific Rise</b> (&gt;15 cm/yr, ~3,400 km west of Chile)'),
