     ['<b>Divergent</b> (constructive)', 'move apart', 'new crust, mid-ocean ridges, rift valleys, volcanic islands, shallow quakes', 'Mid-oceanic ridges, Great African Rift (Lebanon → Mozambique), Chagos'],
