  bx('bl', '<b>Indian plate:</b> island off Australia first; Himalayas still rising. Margins: <b>E</b> Arakan Yoma → Java Trench · <b>W</b> Kirthar · <b>N</b> Himalaya. <b>Limits of theory:</b> doesn’t explain <b>hotspots</b>; can’t place ancient plates or predict future boundaries.'),
  bx('gr', '<b>PYQ 2013 (ans d):</b> electromagnetic radiation, geothermal energy, gravity, plate movement, rotation, revolution: <b>all</b> cause dynamic surface change (radiation → temperature change, gravity → downslope movement).'),

