  mn('Sill=sill', '<b>Sill</b> = window-sill, flat · <b>Dyke</b> = wall, upright · <b>Laccolith</b> = <b>L</b>oaf (dome) · <b>Lopolith</b> = <b>Lota</b> (bowl/saucer) · <b>Phacolith</b> = wavy'),
  mn('I HaveSomeVada-Pav,Please', 'Eruption styles calm → crazy: <b>I</b>celandic (fissure, basalt) → <b>H</b>awaiian (central vent, most lava) → <b>S</b>trombolian (short bursts, pasty lava) → <b>V</b>ulcanian (dark cauliflower clouds) → <b>P</b>elean (most dangerous, glowing clouds) → <b>P</b>linian (ash up to 50,000 ft, deadly pyroclastic flows)'),
  t('<b>Types of volcano</b>', '<b>By frequency</b>: Active (St Helens, Merapi) · Dormant (Vesuvius before <b>AD 79</b>) · Extinct (Narcondam)', '<b>By shape</b>: cinder cone · composite (strato) · shield', 'Vulcanian/Pelean/Plinian ash = <b>hygroscopic nuclei</b> → rain + ash → <b>lahars</b> (mudflows)'),
  t('<b>Mantle plume and hotspot</b>', 'Rising heat arm in mantle; <b>intra-plate</b> (not at boundaries)', 'Plate moves over it → <b>island chains</b> (Hawaii); cut off from heat → extinct', '<b>Azores</b>: hotspot + Mid-Atlantic ridge', '<b>Réunion hotspot</b>: active <b>&gt;65 million yrs</b>; Indian plate passing over it → <b>Deccan Traps</b>'),
