  t('<b>Karst</b>', 'Named after a province of Yugoslavia (now Slovenia) on Adriatic coast', 'Thick limestone, dolomite or gypsum; rock dense, highly jointed, thickly bedded', t('<b>Erosional</b>', '<b>Sinkholes/swallow holes</b> (3–9 m; dolines, uvalas, polje)', '<b>Lapies</b> (grooves and ridges)', 'karst window, arch/bridge, caves, blind valley'), t('<b>Depositional (speleothems, in caves)</b>', '<b>Stalactite</b> hangs from roof', '<b>Stalagmite</b> rises from floor', '<b>Column</b> when joined', 'flowstone, cave pearls, draperies')),
